  "text": "\r\n\t\t 4. Election Information | Derry, NH \r\n Skip to Main Content \r\nCreate a Website Account   - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.    \r\nWebsite Sign In \r\n     Discover Derry   \t\t\t \n     Departments   \t\t\t \n     Government   \t\t\t \n     Doing Business   \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t Search \n\t\t\t 1. Dog License \r\n\t\t\t 2. Birth, Death, Divorce, & Marriage Certificates \r\n\t\t\t 3. Marriage License & Ceremonies \r\n\t\t\t 4. Election Information \r\n\t\t\t 5. Additional Information \r\n\t\t\t 6. Newsletter \r\nHome \nDepartments \nTown Clerk \n4. Election Information \r\n4. Election Information\t\t \r\n2026 Sample Ballot \nNEXT ELECTION : STATE GENERAL - NOVEMBER 3, 2026 - PINKERTON ACADEMY 7 am-8 pm. \nAbsentee Ballot Application:  2026 General Election \nReturn Email:  [email protected] \nReturn Mailing Address: 14 Manning St, Derry, NH 03038 \n657:17-c Verification of Absentee Ballot Applicant. -I. Every applicant for an absentee ballot shall provide verification before being issued an absentee ballot. \nVerification shall be satisfied by one of the following methods: \nIncluding a copy of the voter's photo identification with the absentee ballot application. The identification shall meet the requirements of RSA 659:13, II(a); \nIncluding a notarized signature on the absentee ballot application form; or \nPersonally presenting a qualifying photo identification, as defined in RSA 659:13, II(a), to the city or town clerk or their designee prior to the issuance of the absentee ballot. \nII. No absentee ballot shall be issued unless one of the verification methods under paragraph I has been satisfied. \nSource. 2025, 302:1, eff. September 30, 2025. \nTown and School Offices up for Election in March 2027 \nVOTING INFORMATION TOWN CONTACTS \nDerry Election Officials Town Moderator:  David Nelson \nLook Up Your District Town Clerk:  Cristina Guilford \nMap of Voting Districts Deputy Town Clerk:  Brianna Haller \nPolling Locations Supervisor of Checklist:  Leslie Dombroski \nSupervisors of the Checklist Supervisor of Checklist:  Cynthia Messina \nVoter Registration Supervisor of Checklist:  Judy Strakalaitis \nTOWN and SCHOOL ELECTION RESULTS HISTORY \n2026 March 10, 2026 - Town and School Election Results \n2025 March 11, 2025 - Town and School Election Results \n2024 March 12, 2024 - Town and School Election Results \n2023 March 14, 2023 - Town and School Election Results \n2022 March 8, 2022 - Town and School Election Results \n2021 March 9, 2021 - Town and School Election Results \n2020 March 10, 2020 - Town and School Election Results \n2019 March 12, 2019 - Town and School Election Results \n2018 March 13, 2018 - Town and School Election Results \n2017 March 21, 2017 - Town and School Election Results \n2016 March 8, 2016 - Town and School Election Results \r\nContact Us \r\nTown Clerk \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Physical Address \r\n View Map \t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t\t Derry Municipal Center \n\t\t\t\t\t\t 14 Manning Street \n\t\t\t\t\t Derry ,  NH   03038 \r\nDerry Municipal Center 14 Manning Street Derry NH 03038 \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t Directions \r\nPhone:  603-432-6105 \r\nFax: 603-432-8176 \r\nHours of Operation \nM, T, T & F 7 am - 4 pm \nW 7 am - 5 pm \r\n\t\t\t\t\tCristina Guilford\r\nTown Clerk \r\nEmail Cristina Guilford \r\n\t\t\t Agendas &  Minutes \r\n\t\t\t Payments \r\n\t\t\t Forms & Documents \r\n\t\t\t Contact Us \r\n\t\t\t Bids & RFPs \r\n\t\t\t Employment \r\n\t\t\t Online Mapping Portal \r\n\t\t\t Exit 4A \r\n\t\t\t Permits \r\n\t\t\t Election Info \n\t\t\t Planning & Zoning Applications \n\t\t\t Derry CAM \nContact Us \r\nTown of Derry - Municipal Center \n14 Manning Street, Derry, N.H. 03038 \n(603) 432-6100 \nHours: Mon-Fri 7am-4pm \nTax Office and Town Clerk \nExtended Hours: Weds until 5pm. \r\nPopular Links \r\n         Town Code \n         CodeRED Sign Up \n         Explore Derry \n         Derry Homegrown Farm & Artisan Market \n         State & Federal Resources \n/